  <HPWC_Combat_Dismember.rulePack.rulesStrings>
    <li>r_logentry(recipient_part0_destroyed==True)->[INITIATOR_definite]扯下了[RECIPIENT_definite]的[recipient_part0_label]。</li>
    <li>r_logentry(recipient_part0_destroyed==True)->[INITIATOR_definite]把[RECIPIENT_definite]的[recipient_part0_label]硬生生撕了下來。</li>
    <li>r_logentry(recipient_part0_destroyed==True,p=0.5)->[INITIATOR_definite]抓住[RECIPIENT_definite]，扯下了[RECIPIENT_possessive][recipient_part0_label]。</li>
    <li>r_logentry(recipient_part0_destroyed==False)->[INITIATOR_definite]試圖扯下[RECIPIENT_definite]的[recipient_part0_label]，卻只造成了傷害。</li>
    <li>r_logentry(recipient_part0_destroyed==False)->[INITIATOR_definite]撕扯[RECIPIENT_definite]的[recipient_part0_label]，使其受了傷。</li>
    <li>r_logentry(recipient_part0_destroyed==False,p=0.5)->[INITIATOR_definite]想撕下[RECIPIENT_definite]的[recipient_part0_label]，但沒能扯斷。</li>
  </HPWC_Combat_Dismember.rulePack.rulesStrings>
